  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GURT Core Support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">GURT k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att ge tre &#xe5;rs k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till en ledande ukrainsk civilsamh&#xe4;lleorganisation som f&#xf6;respr&#xe5;kar transparens samt ett konkurrerensbaserat demokratiskt civilsamh&#xe4;lle.

Detta &#xe4;r en andra fas av k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till organisationen GURT. Den f&#xf6;rsta fasen av k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till GURT t&#xe4;ckte perioden 01.02 2012 - 31.12.2014.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide 3-year core support to a leading Ukrainian civil society communication platform NGO that advocates for a transparent, resilient, and democratic civil society space.

This is a second cycle of core support to the organization GURT Resource Center. GURT received core support during the period 01.02.2012 - 31.12.2014.</narrative>
  </description>
